    "##  Dataset Documentation\n",
    "\n",
    "| Item | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **Dataset name** | Telco Customer Churn |\n",
    "| **Source** | IBM Watson Analytics / IBM Cloud Pak sample dataset (also on Kaggle as *\"Telco Customer Churn\"* by BlastChar). Public copy: `github.com/IBM/telco-customer-churn-on-icp4d` |\n",
    "| **Business / domain** | Telecommunications – subscription (phone + internet) services |\n",
    "| **Number of rows** | 7,043 (one row = one customer) |\n",
    "| **Number of columns** | 21 |\n",
    "| **Target variable** | `Churn` (Yes / No) – did the customer leave within the last month? → **binary classification** |\n",
    "| **Why this dataset?** | It has numerical *and* categorical columns, 7k+ records, a clear business question (why do customers leave?), and **realistic data-quality issues**: `TotalCharges` is stored as text with hidden blank strings, `SeniorCitizen` is a categorical flag stored as 0/1, several columns contain redundant \"No internet service\" / \"No phone service\" levels, and there are class imbalance and skewed/bimodal distributions. |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Important columns\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column | Meaning | Kind |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `customerID` | Unique customer identifier | Identifier |\n",
    "| `gender` | Female / Male | Categorical (nominal) |\n",
    "| `SeniorCitizen` | 1 if customer is 65+ else 0 | Categorical (binary, stored as int) |\n",
    "| `Partner`, `Dependents` | Has a partner / dependents | Categorical (binary) |\n",
    "| `tenure` | Months the customer has stayed with the company | Numerical – discrete |\n",
    "| `PhoneService`, `MultipleLines` | Phone service flags | Categorical |\n",
    "| `InternetService` | DSL / Fiber optic / No | Categorical (nominal) |\n",
    "| `OnlineSecurity`, `OnlineBackup`, `DeviceProtection`, `TechSupport`, `StreamingTV`, `StreamingMovies` | Add-on services | Categorical |\n",
    "| `Contract` | Month-to-month / One year / Two year | Categorical (ordinal) |\n",
    "| `PaperlessBilling`, `PaymentMethod` | Billing preferences | Categorical |\n",
    "| `MonthlyCharges` | Current monthly bill (USD) | Numerical – continuous |\n",
    "| `TotalCharges` | Total billed over the whole tenure (USD) | Numerical – continuous (stored as text!) |\n",
    "| `Churn` | **Target** – left the company? | Categorical (binary) |"
   ]
