    "## 5. Identifier Columns & Target Variable\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. Concept\n",
    "An **identifier** uniquely labels a record (ID, email). It carries no predictive meaning and must not be used as a feature. The **target** is the column to be predicted.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. Example\n",
    "*Simple:* roll number identifies a student but does not predict marks.  \n",
    "*Business:* `customerID` identifies a customer; `Churn` is the business outcome.  \n",
    "*AI/ML:* an ID with 100% unique values lets a model memorise rows → overfitting.\n",
    "\n",
